{"id":"439f1bdb1c7fbb2e","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-nno-unique-isomorphism.md","title":"Theorem — 自然数对象唯一到唯一相容同构","display":"Theorem — 自然数对象唯一到唯一相容同构","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-nno-unique-isomorphism","aliases":["14-thm-nno-unique-isomorphism"],"display":"Theorem — 自然数对象唯一到唯一相容同构","depends_on":["[[14-df-natural-numbers-object]]"],"source_location":"VI.1, printed 268–269; DjVu 140","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-nno-unique-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-nno-unique-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 自然数对象唯一到唯一相容同构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8ee22b56cc1189dc\" href=\"?note=8ee22b56cc1189dc\" title=\"14-df-natural-numbers-object\">14-df-natural-numbers-object</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"VI.1, printed 268–269; DjVu 140"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；以下范畴及 Hom 集在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为初等拓扑斯；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(N,z,s)\">\\((N,z,s)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(N&#39;,z&#39;,s&#39;)\">\\((N&#39;,z&#39;,s&#39;)\\)</span> 均满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8ee22b56cc1189dc\" href=\"?note=8ee22b56cc1189dc\" title=\"14-df-natural-numbers-object\">14-df-natural-numbers-object</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathcal E}\">\\(\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathcal E}\\)</span>，使用同一个选定终对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N,N&#39;)\\;\\left(u\\circ z=z&#39;\\land u\\circ s=s&#39;\\circ u\\land\\exists v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N&#39;,N)\\;(v\\circ u=\\operatorname{id}_N\\land u\\circ v=\\operatorname{id}_{N&#39;})\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N,N&#39;)\\;\\left(u\\circ z=z&#39;\\land u\\circ s=s&#39;\\circ u\\land\\exists v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N&#39;,N)\\;(v\\circ u=\\operatorname{id}_N\\land u\\circ v=\\operatorname{id}_{N&#39;})\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源说明：以下来源定位与历史核对经历为所附原稿的记录；本次核对对象为本对话提供的数学笔记。</p>\n<p>将第二组递归数据代入第一组自然数对象的泛性质，得到唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span>；反向得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>。复合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"vu\">\\(vu\\)</span> 与恒等箭头都保持 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z,s\">\\(z,s\\)</span>，由同一唯一性有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"vu=1_N\">\\(vu=1_N\\)</span>；同理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"uv=1_{N&#39;}\">\\(uv=1_{N&#39;}\\)</span>。相容条件的唯一性由递归泛性质直接给出。这里的唯一性是保持零和后继的同构，而非任意底层对象同构。</p>\n<p>原稿记录曾读取原书本地 DjVu OCR，并目视核对 DjVu 140 的印刷页 268–269；以下证明为笔记内展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-natural-numbers-object","status":"resolved","id":"8ee22b56cc1189dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-numbers-object]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-numbers-object","status":"resolved","id":"8ee22b56cc1189dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯；$(N,z,s)$、$(N',z',s')$ 均满足 [[14-df-natural-numbers-object]] 的 $\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathcal E}$，使用同一个选定终对象 $1$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"(N,z,s)","display":false},{"tex":"(N',z',s')","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{IsNNO}_{\\mathcal E}","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists!u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N,N')\\;\\left(u\\circ z=z'\\land u\\circ s=s'\\circ u\\land\\exists v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(N',N)\\;(v\\circ u=\\operatorname{id}_N\\land u\\circ v=\\operatorname{id}_{N'})\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"vu","display":false},{"tex":"z,s","display":false},{"tex":"vu=1_N","display":false},{"tex":"uv=1_{N'}","display":false}],"bytes":1710,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-unique-isomorphism|thm-254 — 自然数对象唯一到唯一相容同构]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-unique-isomorphism]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-268","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-unique-isomorphism]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-190","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-unique-isomorphism]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-151","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-nno-unique-isomorphism|thm-254 — 自然数对象唯一到唯一相容同构]]"}],"outgoing":["8ee22b56cc1189dc"]}